==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Promotional Card|Zapdos|P10}} from the {{vg|Pokémon Trading Card Game}} for the [[Game Boy Color]].
*'''Heavy Thunder''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Promotional Card|Zapdos|P10}} from the {{vg|Pokémon Trading Card Game}} for the [[Game Boy Color]] as '''Big Thunder'''.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

